  "reason": "The study reports on the efficacy of stem cells in animal models of spinal cord injury but does not provide a quantitative measure of agreement between animal results and human clinical results. It focuses on the preclinical testing of a specific cell line for a planned clinical trial and discusses the challenges in validating potency assays, rather than comparing the predictive accuracy of animal models to human outcomes."
